<title>FRANCE: TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF MUSTER V GOELLNER.</title>
<headline>TENNIS SPOTLIGHT-STATISTICS OF MUSTER V GOELLNER.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics of Monday's French Open men's singles first round match between fifth seed Thomas Muster of Austria and Germany's Marc- Kevin Goellner.</p>
<p>Muster won 4-6 7-6 (7-4) 6-2 6-7 (2-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Time: three hours nine minutes</p>
<p>MUSTER GOELLNER</p>
<p>Aces 5 25</p>
<p>Double faults 0 6</p>
<p>Percentage first serves 66 50</p>
<p>Forehand winners 28 31</p>
<p>Backhand winners 9 14</p>
<p>Unforced errors 52 89</p>
<p>Break points 17 12</p>
<p>Breaks of serve 6 8</p>
</text>
